{"ignore":[{"p":"v","l":"verb","zh":"忽視、不理會","ex":[{"en":"Why are you ignoring me?","zh":"你為什麼不理我？","s":"t","id":1298430,"by":"alec","zid":1291666,"zby":"Quazel","rev":1,"sp":[12,20]},{"en":"I warned him, but he ignored the warning.","zh":"我警告過他，但他不理會。","s":"t","id":814889,"by":"CK","zid":816805,"zby":"Martha","rev":1,"sp":[21,28]},{"en":"If I were you, I would ignore it.","zh":"如果我是你，我就不理它。","s":"t","id":3468019,"by":"AlanF_US","zid":3468058,"zby":"nemesis","rev":1,"sp":[23,29]}],"g":"vt"}],"ignorant":[{"p":"adj","l":"形容詞","zh":"無知的、不知情的","ex":[{"en":"I am quite ignorant of the plan.","zh":"我對這個計劃一無所知。","s":"t","id":254306,"by":"","zid":380728,"zby":"sherryyyf","sp":[11,19]},{"en":"Many economists are ignorant of that fact.","zh":"很多經濟學家都不知道這點。","s":"t","id":274822,"by":"CK","zid":395194,"zby":"nickyeow","sp":[20,28]},{"en":"Tom is an ignorant fool.","zh":"湯姆是個無知的傻子。","s":"t","id":1497643,"by":"Spamster","zid":9969088,"zby":"GlossaMatik","sp":[10,18]}]}]}